      "side": 1,
      "message": "`RpcServerConnection` has the flag: #[cfg(target_os \u003d \"trusty\")]. So this is specific to Trusty. \n\nTrusty has a trait `UnbufferedService` which has an associated type: `Connection`. \n\nTrusty `RpcServer` implements `UnbufferedService` trait and `RpcServerConnection` is the associated type.\n\nWe need to reference this connection type from other places of trusty TA code. E.g. https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/trusty/app/authmgr/+/3525490/11/authmgr-be/lib/src/server.rs#25",
      "parentUuid": "ea200e5d_8ca13b33",
      "revId": "b3b0e3333652e94541251ca9a5db8e99fdcf750b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d4c3e649_cb5073b1",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
